00:56:05.180 --> 00:56:10.020
<v Ira Glass>Seth Lind is our operations director. Emily Condon's our production manager. Elise Bergerson's our administrative assistant.

00:56:10.020 --> 00:56:16.700
<v Ira Glass>Adrianne Mathiowetz runs our website. Research help from Michelle Harris and Julie Beer. Music help from Damian Gray and from Rob Geddis.

00:56:16.700 --> 00:56:18.210
